WEBVTT

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:22.750
Do you remember?

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:24.790
That night...

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:27.090
It was snowing, just like tonight.

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:28.190
Yes.

00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:34.260
I'll never forget that night as long as I live.

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:39.270
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:42.170
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:49.150
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:53.790
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:01:55.210 --> 00:02:00.020
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:04.110
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:08.810
to save the future of outer space.

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:12.770
It's time to launch!

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:15.950
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:19.870
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:24.570
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:27.530
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:30.450
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:33.200
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:36.710
Pulverizing steel!

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:40.380
Goldion Hammer!

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:47.910
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:53.910
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:56.730
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:56.730 --> 00:03:00.910
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:04.990
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:08.130
GGG Goes to Jupiter!

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:11.200
<i>GGG Goes to Jupiter!</i>

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:31.040
The 31 Machine Primevals are plotting to use Jupiter's energy source...

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:36.090
ChoRyuJin received mysterious powers from an unknown force...

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:38.460
Za Powa, eh?

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:41.990
They created the Zonder who scrambled the broadcast signals...

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:45.790
...to block detection of the Primeval presence and the ES Window!

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:49.630
The 17 remaining Primevals then took off for Jupiter!

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:52.930
And in an attempt to thwart those plans, the J-Ark pursued them...

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:54.570
...only to fall victim to the enemy's trap.

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.940
J-Bird! Plug Out!

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:04.840
J-Der!

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:07.480
Plasma Wing!

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.290
Plasma Sword!

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:17.430
J-Der! At this rate we'll be annihilated!

00:04:17.930 --> 00:04:21.770
I'll cover you! You've got to retreat with Arma! Hurry!

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.340
J-Der...

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:29.010
According to the J-Ark's main computer...

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:32.370
...the enemy has created an assault trap along Jupiter's orbit...

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:34.610
...and is prepared to meet any outside attacks.

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:36.610
J-Der...

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:39.780
He sacrificed himself to save that boy.

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:44.010
Created on the Red Planet...

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:47.620
The Anti-Primeval Living Weapon, Arma.

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:51.230
The Zonder Crystals are attained by Purifying the Primeval Cores.

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:56.030
When all 31 of them are gathered they comprise the Primevals' true form!

00:04:56.340 --> 00:05:00.970
The Program System that controls all Zonders and Zonderians.

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:10.310
The Z-Master!

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:16.050
The power created to destroy the Z-Master...

00:05:16.260 --> 00:05:18.490
That's what the G-Stone and the J-Jewel are.

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:23.320
The Primevals who are left are planning an attack using Za Powa!

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:28.460
If Kaidou and I don't go there now, there's gonna be big trouble!

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:30.230
That's the feeling I get.

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:33.230
It may turn out to be a journey of no return.

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:35.670
Are you still willing to go?

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:40.580
I want to protect my mom and dad and all of my friends!

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:44.550
I just don't want Earth to be destroyed like the other planets were!

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.240
If my power...

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:49.410
If it can help protect the planet that I love...

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:51.490
Then I'm going to fight!

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:54.550
Mamoru...

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:57.090
Let's all join in the fight!

00:05:57.360 --> 00:06:00.600
All right! Effective 24 hours from now...

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:04.040
...Susanoh, Izanagi, and Amaterasu shall be launched.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.500
All GGG members are to prepare for mobilization!

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:07.570
Roger!

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:17.250
System repair complete.

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:18.580
I thank you.

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:21.410
No need to thank me.

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:25.090
I have only fulfilled the task I was charged with.

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:29.760
J-Ark, Main Computer, Tomorrow 017...

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:33.690
GGG Intelligence Unit, Volfogg...

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:36.590
I shall enter that name in my memory.

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:43.800
In this way, GGG began its preparations for the battle on Jupiter.

00:06:44.310 --> 00:06:47.710
As they knew it could very well turn out to be a fateful one-way ticket...

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:51.720
...the members of GGG enjoyed a brief respite, each in their own way.

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:58.720
The city that never sleeps has dozed off. Freedom!

00:06:58.860 --> 00:07:08.910
The new era weeps with grief over a false utopia.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:11.360
That was awesome!

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:13.200
Yeah!

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:19.860
Now I feel a warmth, time freezes and my heart burns.

00:07:17.980 --> 00:07:21.210
Tsugio, Mitsuo, Sueo...

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:26.690
Now the weather is calling the storm and the darkness is thinning.

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:25.240
I'm counting on you to take care of the garden while I'm away.

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:29.150
If I don't make it back, then...

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:33.600
Fight it! Kick the daily boredom!

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:42.820
Fight it out! Bet against the anger stirring inside you! Come on! Power

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:36.090
...I'll definitely make it back!

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:43.660
Let me accept this drink in my father's place.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:47.620
Desire! So vivid!

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:52.570
Listen, that dad of yours was one heck of a system engineer!

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:51.120
Desire! Now hovering far in the sky!

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:54.580
Desire! Transcends time!

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:07.660
Okay!

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:13.360
Oh, no...

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:15.430
Am I tired or something?

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:19.860
Father... Mother...

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:24.640
We'll be going into a crucial battle soon.

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:28.340
I'm going to do everything I can to support Gai till the very end...

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:29.540
So...

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:32.680
Please, wish your Mikoto good luck!

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:37.380
No matter what the reason, I never thought I'd be able to go to Jupiter.

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:39.720
After all, it was because you wanted to find your mother...

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:43.130
...who was lost along with the Jupilos 5 explorer ship...

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:45.930
...that you became an astronaut.

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.230
If Kizuna...

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.940
If your mother were alive now...

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:55.700
Forgive me, Gai...

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:59.080
I know I've made you go through a lot of suffering.

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:01.510
That's not true.

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:05.450
I'm proud of both you and Mom!

00:09:06.590 --> 00:09:07.850
I'm grateful to you both.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:10.890
Thanks.

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:23.160
Kaidou, your mom...

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:25.940
She was really worried about you.

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:33.940
Shouldn't you go see her?

00:09:35.450 --> 00:09:37.080
I really pity you, you know.

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:38.080
Huh?

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:40.810
Neither one of us is from this planet.

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:43.550
We have to say goodbye sooner or later.

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:50.960
That's why I never let myself love anyone or let anyone love me.

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:52.920
Even if I were to disappear...

00:09:54.270 --> 00:09:55.900
...nobody would be sad.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:00.170
That means I won't have to suffer like you when the time comes.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:02.470
Kaidou...

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:11.980
The following day, having finished all preparations, the GGG crew...

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:16.920
...initiated its launch to far-off Jupiter, along with the J-Ark.

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:23.960
All members of the Gutsy Galaxy Guard...

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:29.260
As well as all of our comrades on Earth listening... Attention, please.

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:32.930
We humans are not so powerless that...

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:37.070
...we're going to just sit back and allow ourselves to be hunted down!

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:41.980
We are intelligent life-forms with great wisdom and the will to survive!

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:44.280
GGG will now take off...

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:47.220
...and head for Jupiter, where the decisive battle will be fought!

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:49.510
Allow me to promise you...

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:52.620
As long as each and every one of you can hold onto your courage...

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:57.320
...it will be those of us from Earth that shall emerge victorious in the end!

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:00.900
Gutsy Galaxy Guard!

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:04.070
All crew members, mobilize for battle on Jupiter!

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:16.310
ES Missile, fire!

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:17.680
Roger!

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:31.190
Even if I were to disappear...

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:33.960
...nobody would be sad.

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:37.930
That's not true, Kaidou.

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:40.430
It's the same for you as it is for me.

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:48.550
There's someone who loves you.

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:53.550
Mamoru...

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:57.460
Please come back. Promise me, you've got to promise me!

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:25.040
Is something wrong, Big Brother Gai?

00:12:25.850 --> 00:12:27.290
Huh? Uh, no...

00:12:27.690 --> 00:12:28.980
It's nothing.

00:12:30.490 --> 00:12:33.290
Just as I thought, that's not a real image of the girl.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:35.860
She's appearing directly inside my image processor.

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:40.490
She always looks like she wants to tell me something.

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:43.190
I get the feeling that...

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:46.330
...thanks to that girl, I've been rescued from danger more than once.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.880
You only appear to me when I'm in outer space.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:53.280
Who in the world are you?

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:59.150
Is something terrible going to happen?

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:05.180
Traveling through a parallel space ruled by different laws of physics...

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:07.450
...is certainly stressful!

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:17.300
Remaining time before we arrive at the ES Window to Jupiter...

00:13:17.370 --> 00:13:20.070
...318 seconds in spaceship time.

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:24.940
Anticipating a concentrated assault by the enemy once...

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:27.240
...they reach Jupiter through the ES Window...

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:30.280
...the J-Ark will advance in front of the Primevals, acting as a decoy.

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:34.590
Meanwhile, the GGG fleet will sweep around to a position facing the...

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:37.380
...enemy through a Bypass Window created by firing ES depth charges...

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:39.360
...and from there, launch a surprise attack.

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:45.720
Final Fusion!

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:03.510
GaoGaiGar!

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:07.450
All right! All systems go!

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:09.380
Mamoru, any anomalies?

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:12.290
No, everything's fine, Big Sister Mikoto.

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:14.730
Now loading ES depth charges!

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:16.960
GaoGaiGar is now fully armed!

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:21.660
Volfogg, computer access.

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:25.300
GekiRyuJin, Goldytank, ChoRyuJin, stand by!

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:28.740
The Mic Brigade is ready to mobilize anytime!

00:14:31.610 --> 00:14:32.740
J-Der...

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:35.510
Now dropping ES depth charges!

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:44.010
Bypass window, opening!

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:47.390
J-Ark...

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:49.520
We wish you every success!

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:51.450
We'll see you on Jupiter!

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:09.950
This ultragravity wave...

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.050
Is it the Arm Primeval?

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:18.950
Jupiter's secondary satellite, Europa...

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:20.380
Is that...

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:23.060
...a Primeval fused with a planet?

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:24.730
So you've fallen for my trap!

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:40.510
What's going on here?

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:41.680
It's a Primeval!

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:44.570
The 16 satellites of Jupiter?

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:47.250
Don't tell me it's fused itself with such a colossal entity!

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:55.520
GGG Space Fleet... now starting the sealing process.

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:11.470
Oh, no! We've fallen for the enemy's trap!

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:14.170
I'm detecting a powerful repression field!

00:16:14.710 --> 00:16:17.550
The space surrounding the fleet is gradually being warped!

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:18.720
No!

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:26.290
Sealing complete.

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:31.890
Information gathering... transmission of commands complete.

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:34.130
Terminal functions disabled.

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:39.770
Assimilation process started. Now launching final program!

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:57.750
What's this? This space?

00:16:58.060 --> 00:17:00.030
Here's a conceptual diagram of my analysis.

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:03.190
It's no good! The surrounding area is completely sealed off.

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:06.600
It's warped space, what you'd call Klein Space.

00:17:07.070 --> 00:17:10.040
Theoretically, it's an application of dividing energy...

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:12.090
...but it's warped at an astonishing level!

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:14.770
Professor! Is there any way to escape?

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:19.680
It's useless to resist!

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:22.150
No! So we were too late?

00:17:24.320 --> 00:17:25.750
You fools!

00:17:25.820 --> 00:17:29.450
Who knew that you'd fall for the same ploy as J-Der!

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:32.190
I'll just seal you away too!

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:34.890
I never thought he'd see through our strategy!

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:41.530
Generating Armor, maximum power!

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:53.750
Fire all maser missiles!

00:17:53.810 --> 00:17:54.540
Roger!

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:59.810
Now that J-Ark has lost J-Der...

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:03.110
...I wonder how long you can...

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:06.020
...withstand the Wing Primeval's unlimited assault?

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:12.090
Unable to load the missiles fast enough!

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:15.460
Generating Armor, damage level 19%!

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:18.830
Latio...

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:20.970
Kaidou?

00:18:23.510 --> 00:18:25.370
Aha, aha, aha!

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:27.640
Ah, it's just as I thought.

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:28.650
Volfogg!

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:31.820
There is an element of risk, but we have no apparent alternatives.

00:18:32.050 --> 00:18:33.710
Mmm, all right!

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:36.050
Double-head Driver, launch!

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:40.450
Assault Reconnaissance Cutter Murakumo!

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:42.150
Standby, okay!

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:44.560
Professor, will you be all right on your own?

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:47.800
Well, I'm the only one who can handle this job!

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:49.600
Just leave it to me!

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:53.570
Inside the Klein Space...

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:58.080
...there's a unique point of conflict where the maximum curvature rate...

00:18:58.140 --> 00:19:01.080
...of both the repression field and the arresting field meet.

00:19:01.880 --> 00:19:05.510
By using Murakumo's special sensors, I can determine where that point is.

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:11.260
And by creating a repression field with the Dividing Driver...

00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:15.520
...then destroying it with the focused broken energy of the Gatling Driver...

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:17.930
...you can create an escape point, right?

00:19:18.100 --> 00:19:19.090
That's right!

00:19:19.230 --> 00:19:21.030
That's my kid brother!

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:28.600
That's it right there! No question about it!

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:32.310
Professor, according to the Multi-Dimensional mainframe...

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:35.400
...the amount of time you'll be able to keep that escape route open...

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:37.850
...is no more than one-fiftieth of a second.

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:39.350
What the!

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:42.280
Dad! Let's give it a shot!

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:47.460
It's no good. Even GaoGaiGar equipped for outer space...

00:19:47.530 --> 00:19:49.930
...isn't capable of escaping within one-fiftieth of a second.

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:53.790
The only one who could possibly pull that off...

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:55.460
...is me!

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:57.130
J-Der!

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:01.460
J-Der! So you survived!

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:03.400
Where's Arma?

00:20:03.810 --> 00:20:06.440
Kaidou, you mean? He's probably in battle with the Primevals now!

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:09.740
I see. In that case, then, we'd better hurry!

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:17.460
Are the others all trapped inside that thing?

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:22.490
Double-head Driver!

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:42.170
We're counting on you, J-Der!

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:46.990
On course for an infinite direct hit!

00:20:57.860 --> 00:20:58.690
J-Der!

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:01.120
Let's go!

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:03.870
Mega-fusion!

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:19.040
King J-Der!

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:24.580
Simultaneous Barrage!

00:21:28.860 --> 00:21:29.760
Where are you?

00:21:29.860 --> 00:21:30.950
J-Quath!

00:21:46.810 --> 00:21:49.940
Oh! The Klein Space is gone!

00:21:50.180 --> 00:21:52.380
Now detecting the Primeval Satellite and King J-Der!

00:21:52.650 --> 00:21:54.680
All ships, rapid launch!

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:57.050
Support King J-Der in battle!

00:21:57.290 --> 00:21:58.450
Roger!

00:22:06.400 --> 00:22:08.530
What's wrong? Why are you crying?

00:22:09.070 --> 00:22:10.190
Big Brother Gai?

00:22:13.210 --> 00:22:15.440
17 Primevals in all...

00:22:15.780 --> 00:22:17.000
One's missing.

00:22:17.840 --> 00:22:19.440
Where's the last one?

00:22:19.780 --> 00:22:20.540
Huh?

00:22:21.680 --> 00:22:22.440
Jupiter?

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:26.280
No!

00:22:26.920 --> 00:22:27.750
Dad!

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:28.690
Leo!

00:22:28.690 --> 00:22:29.450
Professor!

00:22:31.360 --> 00:22:32.590
Dad!

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:50.370
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:55.240
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:01.420
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:06.210
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:10.380
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:17.310
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:24.070
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:28.730
...let's believe in them now.

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:34.070
When you and I are grown up

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:41.070
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.460 --> 00:23:48.230
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.700 --> 00:23:50.190
GaoGaiGar has disappeared somewhere on Jupiter...

00:23:50.270 --> 00:23:52.100
...in pursuit of Dr. Shishioh!

00:23:52.310 --> 00:23:53.930
As they face the invincible Primeval forces...

00:23:54.010 --> 00:23:57.570
...have our heroes finally run out of ways to break through to victory?

00:23:57.940 --> 00:24:00.440
No, we still have one thing left and that's courage!

00:24:00.510 --> 00:24:03.910
We must believe! That our King of Braves will return!

00:24:04.180 --> 00:24:06.080
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:06.150 --> 00:24:07.380
"Those Who Have Courage"

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:06.840
Those Who Have Courage

00:24:12.530 --> 00:24:15.490
Cain
